$$ \frac{1}{4!}\langle\sigma(x)\sigma(y)S_{\mathrm{int}}^{4}\rangle\supset\frac{1}{4!}\frac{1}{2^{4}}|g|^{4}\int_{\{4\}}\!\langle\sigma_{x}\sigma_{1}^{2}\sigma_{2}^{2}\sigma_{3}^{2}\sigma_{4}^{2}\sigma_{y}\rangle\!\left[\langle\mathcal{V}^{\vphantom{\dagger}}_{1}\mathcal{V}_{2}^{\dagger}\mathcal{V}^{\vphantom{\dagger}}_{3}\mathcal{V}_{4}^{\dagger}\rangle+\text{$\dagger$ perms}\right]\,, $$

